  "summary": "I was a student who attended Hartnell College and CSUMB while participating in a special program known as CSin3. This program permitted me to earn a Bachelor's degree in Computer Science with an emphasis in Software Engineering in only three years. I have extensive experience in full-stack development involving tools and frameworks like Angular 4, Spring Boot, Hibernate, DevOps, etc. I have a passion for composing music and applying my programming skills to build a variety of projects, some of which primarily involve audio manipulation. In the future, as I learn to master my skills, I hope to be able to develop new sound synthesizers that I may use for my music compositions, which is my dream goal. I am also open to Android and iOS app development, data mining, and even game development, which I find interesting to do in my spare time. ",
